%------------------------------------------------------------------------------
% ppg_wtree.pvs
% Algorithmic Lovasz Local Lemma (Moser-Tardos)
%
% The witness tree shape: a finite rooted tree whose nodes carry event
% labels.
%
% PVS port of the WTree datatype of PPGraphMoserTardosWitness.lean
% (Stosic, 2026).
%
% Moser & Tardos, "A constructive proof of the general Lovasz Local
% Lemma", arXiv:0903.0544v3, Section 2: "A witness tree tau = (T, s_T) is
% a finite rooted tree T together with a labelling s_T of its vertices
% with events such that the children of a vertex u receive labels from
% Gamma+(s_T(u))."
%
% Pure shape only. The dependency condition on labels is wf? in
% ppg_mt_witness, the sibling-distinctness condition is proper? there,
% and no link to an actual log is made at this level.
%
% Declared at file level so that PVS generates ppg_wtree_adt, which
% supplies reduce_nat, REDUCE, every, subterm and the well-founded <<
% needed to define recursive functions over the nested list of children.
%
% Author: Dragan Stosic, 2026.
%------------------------------------------------------------------------------

ppg_wtree[I: TYPE+]: DATATYPE
BEGIN
  node(lab: I, children: list[ppg_wtree]): node?
END ppg_wtree
